      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="relative min-h-[92vh] overflow-hidden bg-[#193c31] text-white">
      <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/View_from_chandragiri_32.jpg/1600px-View_from_chandragiri_32.jpg" alt="चन्द्रागिरि हिलको केबल कार माथिल्लो स्टेशन" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-70" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#10231d]/95 via-[#10231d]/62 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-[26%] cable-line"></div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto flex min-h-[92vh] max-w-7xl items-end px-5 pb-16 pt-36 md:px-8 md:pb-24">
        <div class="max-w-4xl">
          <div class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm backdrop-blur">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#d7a332]"></span> चन्द्रागिरि • बागमती • नेपाल
          </div>
          <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[1.05] tracking-tight md:text-7xl">केबल कारबाट<br/><span class="text-[#f1c75b]">बादलमाथि</span> चन्द्रागिरि</h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/85 md:text-xl">२,५२० मिटर उचाइको माथिल्लो स्टेशन—जहाँ केबल कारको रोमाञ्च, भालेश्वर महादेवको आस्था र काठमाडौँ उपत्यकामाथिको विशाल दृश्य एउटै यात्रामा भेटिन्छ।</p>
